{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "a17ea2ad3c516a84c829bd5317140d79f78d1c6235e1292a998c6a2affa376a9", "ja": "マティーニ～はじまりは突然に～", "zh": "马丁尼～突如其来的开始～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "be787190daa96036a688698288a99d3459d418b9e736e039e2e4be2035648b51", "ja": "ライブハウス『クラブミリオン』のイベント\nに出るメンバーを思案中のプロデューサー。\nこのみと莉緒に話をしようとするも、莉緒は\n二日酔いだった。そこに詩花が現れ、「セク\nシーの極意を教えてください！」と告げる。", "zh": "正在思考参加Live House“Club Million”活动的成员的制作人。\n制作人正想和木实、莉绪聊聊，莉绪却宿醉未醒。\n这时诗花出现了，说道：“请教我性感的真谛吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a0d6bfe50dc0204745f2aa79b621fe7b02ecf1e04adf47842b637f88e654a50a", "ja": "（クラブミリオンの話をしようと思ったんだけど、\n莉緒が電話に出ないな。もしかして……）", "zh": "（本来想聊聊Club Million的事，可莉绪一直没接电话。难道说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cce6d7a25016bb6f350502e5929082be7f31d0b781b4623ec92b46933497fcb8", "ja": "なんとなく、このみさんなら知ってるような気がする。\n……試しに電話してみよう。", "zh": "总觉得，这种事问问木实小姐或许会知道。\n……先试着打个电话吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1002_null", "source_sha256": "9b1a0adc36bb13570149ea412ee622fd70a6a98e71d23f36d2040c045735fa37", "ja": "プルルルルル……。", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "334d9531f194c39a2e5d70e84a27b884cce8ab3161de695b6b00b7bb2345cc24", "ja": "あら、{$P$}？\nこんな早い時間に、どうかしたの？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}？\n这么早有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "495f2ee75cc58b574b0661c217f34c4f25fee424e2b849a166a61c0c88e6c8c8", "ja": "おはようございます、このみさん。\nもしかして、莉緒と一緒ですか？", "zh": "早上好，木实小姐。您该不会是和莉绪在一起吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "1c6707d3b69c768ef5c42da39e9e74143ee3336b2bd9bb983449435b9c720f6c", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん？\nええ、莉緒ちゃんならウチにいるわよ！", "zh": "莉緒？\n嗯，莉緒在我这里哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a99b227ff7e2043d21a831bd266467bfd6723c11acabe16ed924189d210486c", "ja": "そうだ、ちょうど良かったわ。\n{$P$}にお願いがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "对了，正好有件事。\n我有件事想拜托{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "641f92ff06757b28d39c46b2bcd8d667620db0f64e87c32543579bbd0938f253", "ja": "お願いですか？", "zh": "是请求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "80dedd4eab3456f99b388be1e7acdff057bba3e91f311ba41002d879c6a74c65", "ja": "悪かったわね、{$P$}。\n家まで迎えに来てもらっちゃって。", "zh": "不好意思啊，{$P$}。\n还让你到家里来接我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "44ec73959d02a7434436f7a814f47616984051f7a5380f018370695c73189843", "ja": "いえ、このみさんと莉緒に相談したいことがあったので\nちょうど良かったです。それに……。", "zh": "不会，我正好有事想找木美小姐和莉绪商量，\n倒是正合适。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "e6cc3b1019820b3c6f6dbdeab7baacb1a09ab4254c7ea0940312e58cce93e270", "ja": "うう……き、気持ち悪い……。\nあ、頭も……ガンガン、するぅ……。", "zh": "呜呜……好、好难受……  \n头、头也……疼得厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d2df9122bd4edfd6d179da40120bd2452c2af3ba6d0b4dc25758816da30d419d", "ja": "莉緒は、自力じゃ来れなかったかもしれませんし……。", "zh": "莉緒可能靠自己来不了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "75ff12fc52c7fd977dbd2c4626787bfe91acf5de41ab2f9099b54951228e4353", "ja": "心配かけてごめんなさいね。昨夜、莉緒ちゃんと、\nお酒を飲みながら、海外ドラマを一気見しちゃったの。", "zh": "让你担心了，真是不好意思。昨晚我和莉绪一起喝着酒，把海外电视剧一口气看完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "73200425e2170d9180f4b43ff52e763bd77b17120599cb1afb847f52683b84e7", "ja": "それが面白くて、途中で止められなくて……。\nちょっと夜更かししすぎちゃったわね。", "zh": "因为太有意思了，看着看着就停不下来……不小心熬夜熬得有点过头了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2df1fcf555ed7d918c9a31bb6a22e6523a610679418e628fb916c9eb7b0289ef", "ja": "そういうことでしたか……。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "197fa0e52f1fc037380d0335803b3236d07a0e7732b0a2dc78a783abde348d25", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、ほら、劇場に着いたわよ。\n具合はどう？　立てる？", "zh": "莉绪，你看，已经到剧场了。感觉怎么样？能站起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "098f5336a769d74c3d9a96b7d96270679e89bb768b55998e4f85ae4c373feb18", "ja": "だ、大丈夫よ……多分。ううっ、ごめんね、\nこのみ姉さん……{$P$}くんも……。", "zh": "没、没事……大概吧。呜呜，对不起，小此木姐……还有{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6c188b2b984f194073ae126d1073347fdc529fc58c2ed47b4827cb1713b236ca", "ja": "別にいいって。気分が悪いなら、\n仕事の話は少し休んでからにしよう。", "zh": "没事的。要是不舒服，工作的事就等休息一会儿再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "0abb0fa5830613190e929b33840a5c1afee15acffe4d2bfba6d35e0e02a41c85", "ja": "もうちょっとよ、莉緒ちゃん。\n控え室に着いたら、横になりましょう！", "zh": "马上就到了，莉绪。\n等到了休息室，就躺下歇歇吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "dd456e8f3ef40d01ab65fbb2778b9636b76a9266cd31f368bbd4fb247ab5f74b", "ja": "このみ姉さん……{$P$}くんも……\nどうして私に優しいのぉ……くすん。", "zh": "好美姐……还有{$P$}……为什么对我这么温柔啊……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "39d4ee81ee76e4f0cf222abd915cb8e69873ff9c41112b5bcc673bcf16f5ccb1", "ja": "えっ、どうして泣きそうに……？", "zh": "咦，怎么好像快要哭出来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "17628ba1469471a50bbfa775c1cd13081bee73868a03f63bbd8b48833c82ca9a", "ja": "莉緒ちゃんね、飲みすぎた次の日は、\nナーバスになりやすいみたいなの。", "zh": "莉緒啊，喝多了的第二天，\n好像特别容易变得敏感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "c11a4c4f676a31ddbd1f44663112010b31311ae9c96f0f4df2d5b3478a95c661", "ja": "まあ私も、話を聞くことくらいしか\nできないんだけど……。", "zh": "虽然我也只能听她倾诉就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "ff3d7220dea1c62e8f31b633ea2afd1b8e6f6cdc3090b19bf0af11f991b65da2", "ja": "お酒が抜けたら、いつもの莉緒ちゃんに戻るから。\n今は、優しくしてあげてね。", "zh": "酒劲过去后，她就会变回平时的莉绪。\n现在就温柔地对待她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "90ba7583684ba8b78e10bdd1fff0f9e593d3ff54ba14c23637a9bc128c808edf", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました。\n……ん？　あれは……。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了。\n……嗯？那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1026_201xxx", "source_sha256": "91227c0a591ecf53559622a965cd6dd403375508307d9419f89b064d898a7fea", "ja": "あっ！　765プロのみなさん、グリュース・ゴット！\nお会いできてよかったです！", "zh": "啊！765事务所得各位，你们好！\n能见到大家真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "fce4c22341db816c2e45edad1f77b685832ab93db7dee49ff74c293fc45ce016", "ja": "詩花ちゃんじゃない！　いらっしゃい。\n今日は、誰にご用かしら？", "zh": "这不是诗花吗！欢迎呀。今天是来找谁的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1028_201xxx", "source_sha256": "a21440adc929fa2a18b2c5fd6024b0d94fb4f73ae61e073ad1e9c34978aa3136", "ja": "実は……今日は私、\nこのみさんと莉緒さんにお話があって来たんです。", "zh": "其实……我今天来，\n是有事想和木实小姐与莉绪小姐商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "85ad9c459b83b0f9aadcad5f0d332bc3e1424f0f0f64d576b5e15445b019ae7d", "ja": "えっ？　私と莉緒ちゃんに？", "zh": "诶？找我和莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "cbc9b33c406588590165e33ad4ce105ab7bb2d0402c1489b082aef236f7a1469", "ja": "詩花が、このみさんと莉緒に？\n……もしかして、何かあったのか？", "zh": "诗花找这御美和莉緒？\n……莫非发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0110_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_01_1031_201xxx", "source_sha256": "554fdf8798f24614427f02a908dd0bb6f41b514d458b191aaaa29c1578c2bdfc", "ja": "はい。……このみさん、莉緒さん！\nおふたりを師匠と見込んで、お願いがあります！", "zh": "是的。……木实小姐、莉绪小姐！我认定两位是我的师父，有件事想拜托你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
